  {
   "id": "c-eq-5-48",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "Eq. (5.48) writes the decay term with $\\hbar$ and the couplings without it, and Eq. (5.49) repeats the mix. In the frequency units of Eq. (5.1) the decay term is $-\\frac{i\\kgammathree}{2}|3\\rangle\\langle 3|$; with $\\hbar$ kept throughout, the couplings read $-\\hbar(\\kOmegaone^*|1\\rangle\\langle 3| + \\kOmegatwo^*|2\\rangle\\langle 3| + h.c.)$. Either way the dark state of Eq. (5.50) is the same."
  }
