   "id": "dark-resonance-dispersion",
   "what": "the dispersion near the dark resonance",
   "source": "Modern Atomic and Optical Physics II, 5.2 Resonant excitation: Electromagnetically induced transparency, 5.2.1 The dark resonance, Dispersive properties of the dark resonance",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "text": "The coupling field is on resonance, $\\kDeltatwo = 0$, so the probe detuning is $\\kDeltaone = \\kdelta$, and $\\kdelta$ is small.",
       "src": "5.2"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kGammaonetwo = \\kgammaonetwo - i\\kdelta",
       "src": "(5.17)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kGammaonethree = \\kgammaonethree - i\\kDelta",
       "src": "(5.18)"
      },
      {
       "text": "At the dark resonance the metastable decoherence $\\kgammaonetwo$ is small.",
       "src": "5.2"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kchione = \\frac{|\\kmu|^2}{\\hbar\\epsilon_0}\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}",
       "src": "(5.31)"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}} = \\mk{R}{\\frac{i\\kGammaonetwo}{\\kGammaonetwo\\kGammaonethree + |\\kOmegatwo|^2}}",
      "src": "(5.30)",
      "uses": []
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}} = \\mk{R}{\\frac{i(\\kgammaonetwo - i\\kdelta)}{(\\kgammaonetwo - i\\kdelta)(\\kgammaonethree - i\\kdelta) + |\\kOmegatwo|^2}}",
       "uses": [0, 1, 2]
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}} \\approx \\mk{R}{\\frac{\\kdelta + i\\kgammaonetwo}{|\\kOmegatwo|^2 + \\kgammaonetwo\\kgammaonethree - i\\kdelta(\\kgammaonetwo + \\kgammaonethree)}}",
       "uses": [0],
       "cap": "To first order in the small $\\delta$."
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\mathrm{Re}[\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}]} \\approx \\mk{R}{\\frac{\\kdelta}{|\\kOmegatwo|^2 + \\kgammaonetwo\\kgammaonethree} - \\frac{\\kgammaonetwo(\\kgammaonetwo + \\kgammaonethree)\\kdelta}{(|\\kOmegatwo|^2 + \\kgammaonetwo\\kgammaonethree)^2}}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "Multiplying above and below by the conjugate of the denominator, still to first order in $\\delta$."
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\mathrm{Re}[\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}]} \\approx \\mk{R}{\\frac{\\kdelta}{|\\kOmegatwo|^2 + \\kgammaonetwo\\kgammaonethree}}",
       "uses": [3],
       "cap": "The second term is smaller than the first by $\\gamma_{12}(\\gamma_{12} + \\gamma_{13})/(|\\Omega_2|^2 + \\gamma_{12}\\gamma_{13})$."
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{c}{\\mathrm{Re}[\\kchi]} \\propto \\mk{L}{\\mathrm{Re}[\\frac{\\krhothreeone}{\\kOmegaone}]} \\approx \\mk{R}{\\frac{\\kdelta}{|\\kOmegatwo|^2 + \\kgammaonetwo\\kgammaonethree}}",
       "uses": [4]
      }
     ],
     "num": "(5.54)"
    }
   ]
  },
